    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Now Hiring: Daytime Security Staff for Apartment Complex&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working hours: 8:00 AM \u2013 6:00 PM</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trial period: 10 days</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three essential rules for security staff:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Always greet the residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Always have guests write their real name in the visitor log.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Never speak to the woman in white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pomegranate Housing Complex</strong> is a first-person horror adventure game where you work as a daytime security guard at a cursed apartment for 10 days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story branches depending on your interactions with residents and visitors\u2014and whether you obey the rules.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ten days of time-limited patrols</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game time advances one hour every 3 real-world minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Time stops during major events.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll move between the guard room and the apartment building, carrying out tasks such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guard Room:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/473610afa6205210d87bf9f2a726dfd0.poster.avif?t=1749246864\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/473610afa6205210d87bf9f2a726dfd0.webm?t=1749246864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/473610afa6205210d87bf9f2a726dfd0.mp4?t=1749246864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitoring surveillance camera footage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checking the visitor log and resident list</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greeting residents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handling phone calls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apartment Building:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrolling each floor and the rooftop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responding to unusual occurrences</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Breaking the rules will corrupt the ordinary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several rules govern your job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking them increases your &quot;Haunting Level.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it rises too high, you'll lose control and face consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But some events... can only be witnessed if the haunting is strong enough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the hidden pasts of residents and guests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644630/extras/20c383e476f4fc8a0b1e1668983c2db3.avif?t=1749246864\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Residents and visitors follow fixed routines\u2014appearing only at specific times and days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your involvement may cause their behavior to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether to face their hidden pain and trauma is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple routes, multiple endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices, rule adherence, and how you connect with others will shape the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some scenes and endings will only occur under specific conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several endings exist\u2014ranging from calm resolution to eerie revelations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Why are you in a place like this?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
